      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员，涡轮的下个目标是什么比赛？\n是代替帝王跑“宝冢纪念”之类的吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "19718610454b1201a304b9d7ad094cb68275ae6f9b040eed06431eb34b9bd9a6",
