      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我摇了摇头。双涡轮该当成目标的不是GⅠ，\n而是能她完全燃烧，专属于她自己的跑法。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a022c915996ef4e2efa2178a49aed64074e9059cc7f0e773fba93c2cb834b6e2",
